のファンですので、自由に描いていただけましたら嬉しいです。  \n\n・使用用途 \nいただいたイラストは眺めるだけの個人利用をします。各種アイコンなどには使用いたしませんし、再配布、加工などもいたしません。くる様が掲載されたときは全力で拡散いたします。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1460281, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "クロイノα", "screen_name": "orusuta961", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/919914508411273218/ioYQc2y-.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/290579873/1742033266/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 32, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 2369610, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "脆澄ずい", "screen_name": "Zuui_mofu", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1689247708576628736/qZy2RM7U.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1344673445188046848/1678699302/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161}, {"id": 2620286, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "いかわさ🦑(チゲ味)", "screen_name": "Midori_annte23", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1772462509385269248/3WO5dS3i.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1288136668696809473/1711452276/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 110, "skills": [{"genre": "art